Subject: Big-endian: clean up the PR core for Linux, fill the gaps

- drop the AmigaOS guards and debug dumps; lift the static_assert
- IStream: compile error for raw structs without a conversion; coordinate
  structs; ReadArray/WriteArray bytes only
- TD4/TD6/TD7 track designs (import and export), scores.dat, file indexes
- g1/sprite tool element tables, RLE magnify row offsets, PNG importer
- Sawyer chunk headers and checksums, RCT1 checksum
- tile elements: TileElement::LittleEndianToHost with host-ordered union
  bytes (path additionStatus, track sequence); park TILES chunk and
  serialiser
- Ogg/FLAC decode to host order, 16/8-bit texture copy, CP1252 lookup
- Endianness tests host-independent; scripting tests only with scripting
- DISABLE_HTTP build: missing <future>

